courses.learning_outcomes:
Upon completing the studio, students will be able to:

* Learn from key examples of sustainable urban planning;
* Understand how to organise a sustainable development strategy that will integrate economic, social and environmental perspectives;
* Create a comprehensive urban planning strategy by learning to work in different scales in the fields of urban planning, urban design, and ecology;
* Understand and balance different priorities and strategies to create sustainable urban environments;
* Develop spatial planning and design thinking skills, expressed through effective presentation and visual communication materials which explore and present abstract and context-specific planning strategies.
